Trying to be as spoiler-free as possible:

The darts probably differ in some way that you can't tell--either they're
blessed/uncursed/cursed [BUC status], or -1/+0/+3/etc. [enchantment], or
some combination thereof (which is most likely).  To find out these stats,
you need to identify them with the appropriate spell (nb: you can determine
the BUC status at an altar, but that doesn't tell you the enchantment level.

Which basically means that they really are different types of darts, so you
can't combine them (easily.  You can change their status/enchantment, of
course, to make them the same...).  You may want to find a bag to put excess
stuff into.

